  "item_short_desc": "<p>Whether you are heading into the mountains or out in the field, our Midnight Camo Flannel Shirts offer unbeatable warmth and comfort. These heavyweight camouflage flannels are great for either wearing on their own or layering as a shirt jacket, ideal for any wardrobe or tactical loadout. These tactical flannels are perfect for camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, and other outdoor activities.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133407",
  "description": "<p>Whether you are heading into the mountains or out in the field, our Midnight Camo Flannel Shirts offer unbeatable warmth and comfort. These heavyweight camouflage flannels are great for either wearing on their own or layering as a shirt jacket, ideal for any wardrobe or tactical loadout. These tactical flannels are perfect for camping, hiking, hunting, fishing, and other outdoor activities. Ultimate Stealth Ops Camo: Inspired by stealth operations that require zero visibility to the opposition, Rothco has reinvented the classic Woodland Camouflage Pattern as well as our bestselling Black Camouflage Pattern to bring you the Midnight Camo Collection. The subdued color combinations offer a true stealth, sharp and sleek appearance whether on mission or off. Rugged Material Construction: The flannel shirt jacket is crafted from heavyweight (8 oz) cotton fabric that is breathable, comfortable, and warm. From shoveling snow to fall cleanup, the durable camo shirt overcomes any strenuous outdoor activity while providing long-lasting comfort and warmth. Classic Design: The camouflage shacket features a 6-button closure, 2 button-down front flap pockets, and single-button wrist cuffs for timeless style and comfortable wear. Both chest pockets are ideal for storing small EDC essentials and tactical accessories. Care Instructions: For best fit and finish, machine wash cold, non-chlorine bleach when needed, do not tumble dry, and warm iron if needed.</p>",
